{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/capital-bay-damac-properties-business-bay","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":298,"crm_id":"2414","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Capital Bay","slug":"capital-bay-damac-properties-business-bay","display_address":"Business Bay","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Damac Properties","price":20485000,"display_price":"20.485M","lattitude":25.1767864,"longitude":55.2666775,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Capital Bay is an impressive residential development by Damac Properties that towers over the Dubai Canal in the prestigious Business Bay neighborhood. The complex consists of two towers of 22 floors, united by a common podium. The building is constructed with the use of the most advanced technologies. The <strong>studios and one, two and three-bedroom apartments</strong> feature luxurious interiors and high-quality finishes, as well as spacious living areas with huge windows offering spectacular views of the Burj Khalifa and Dubai Canal.</p><p>Capital Bay's proximity to the business center and Downtown Dubai makes it an ideal choice for both business travelers and those who value practicality and comfort. Capital Bay offers its residents a wide range of amenities including a temperature-controlled swimming pool, gym with steam rooms and sauna, children's playground, green park, covered parking, sports court and barbecue facilities.</p><p>Capital Bay is conveniently located close to Dubai's key highways - Al-Khail Road and Sheikh Mohammed bin Zayed. Within a few minutes' drive of the complex is the Dubai Design District, a hub of creativity and fashion. A ten-minute drive from the towers is the largest shopping center - Dubai Mall. Dubai International Airport can be reached in 20 minutes and the world's largest airport, Al Maktoum International Airport, in 40 minutes.</p><p>Capital Bay is an ideal choice for those who appreciate comfort and convenience and are looking for a modern lifestyle in the heart of Dubai's vibrant city center.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2414/images/2024/07/03/5yluw6C7JDjaCvP2TcZ3rbQTkczFHNbtdHkf3MOE.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/03/5yluw6C7JDjaCvP2TcZ3rbQTkczFHNbtdHkf3MOE.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2414/images/2024/07/03/M8QDJEYhN8Xtzb0gQRetMNhRPoAOt3Yd8CdRPPVP.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/03/M8QDJEYhN8Xtzb0gQRetMNhRPoAOt3Yd8CdRPPVP.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2414/images/2024/07/03/WMBLiv1kxetmcMkQhA7oQwyz2CltTE8lg1zp7eiH.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/03/WMBLiv1kxetmcMkQhA7oQwyz2CltTE8lg1zp7eiH.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2376,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1614,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1715,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1716,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1717,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"100%","payment_plans":[{"id":7435,"title":"100%","description":"Full Pay"}],"community":"Business Bay","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":13926,"url":nu